contentText:
Feid officially launches his own record label called Grabaciones Los Poderosos, Billboard can exclusively announce today (March 12). The label will operate under a distribution agreement with Universal Music Latin Entertainment.

&#8220;For me, this is a new chapter, a very special moment in my career, something I&#8217;ve dreamed of since I was a child,” the Colombian artist says. “It was also part of my famous manifestation board, and it has always been an ambition of mine to have my own label and my own work, not only for this chapter of my career as a musician, but also to be able to develop new artists at some point, to have the means to take them where they deserve to be.”

