The announcement also comes on the heels of Feid receiving a Grammy nomination for best música urbana album with FERXXO VOL. X: Sagrado , an album he produced entirely himself.

Based in Miami with a presence in Medellín, the first releases from Grabaciones Los Poderosos will be available soon.&nbsp;
